  "description": "Certificate of\r\nLawful Proposed Development:&nbsp;Change of use from single dwelling (C3) to&nbsp;HMO for up to 6 people&nbsp;(C4),&nbsp;Alterations to\r\nroof to form end gable and rear dormer, Installation\r\nof two roof lights in front elevation, Single storey rear extension",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height: 115%;&quot;&gt;The\r\nproposed development would be within the tolerances of Schedule 2, Part 1,\r\nClasses A, B and C of the Town and Country Planning (General Permitted\r\nDevelopment) Order 2015 (as amended).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height: 115%;&quot;&gt;The\r\nproposed use of the dwellinghouse as a House of Multiple Occupancy for up to 6\r\npersons (Use Class C4) is within the tolerances of Class L of Part 3, Schedule\r\n2 of The Town and Country Planning (General Permitted Development) (England)\r\nOrder 2015 (as amended).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height: 115%;&quot;&gt;The\r\nproposal is therefore a lawful development.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;"
